Rationale:
rmux is a small-enough Cargo workspace from the candidate list to exercise the
first Rust/Cargo onboarding without also needing a Node, WASM, or system C
library pipeline. The first Bazel port intentionally builds the terminal
binary with Cargo's `--no-default-features`, matching a Bazel-native build that
does not enable rmux's optional web-share crypto feature.
